{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-smooth-tobacco","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Smooth Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003ePod Salt Freebase Smooth Tobacco delivers the classic taste of premium tobacco with a smooth, mellow finish for an authentic vaping experience. This 60ml e-liquid is available in 3mg and 6mg nicotine strengths, perfectly crafted for those who enjoy a rich tobacco flavor without harshness. Packaged in a Gorilla bottle, it ensures easy refilling and consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Smooth and Rich Tobacco\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle (leak-proof design)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreebase Formula: Designed for realistic tobacco satisfaction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaping Style: Ideal for DTL and restricted DTL vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Quality: Authentic taste, perfect for smokers switching to vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991061798967,"sku":"Pod S - Smooth Tobacco - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991061831735,"sku":"Pod S - Smooth Tobacco - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-smooth-tobacco.webp?v=1763436877","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-smooth-tobacco","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




